    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Underside: The Lift</strong> - A single-player <strong>horror roguelike</strong> with <strong>survival</strong> elements.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive in a house where every apartment could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/fa02dbf972782cc00c440e046c2b4591.webp?t=1749992298\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a familiar yet distorted place,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >as if you\u2019ve entered its darker reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As if you\u2019ve stepped into the Underside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The silence is suffocating. There\u2019s something behind every door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfamiliar sounds echo like whispers in the dark \u2014 unsettling and real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All you have is an old pipe and a lighter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/2fccb078533768710b40ce5bd30a9794.webp?t=1749992298\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different weapons. Search for notes. Study your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster has its own weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No direct hints. <strong>Only observation and experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/8a7878e9d07965a6c502c1891fb60d8a.webp?t=1749992298\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One life</strong>. One chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die and start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/021f26c5f3726b2af35ef90d6a36e4cc.webp?t=1749992298\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run is a new house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New layout, new monsters, new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: nothing ever repeats here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/b430830471866ee2c113afb4b96547b6.webp?t=1749992298\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The lift</strong> is the only place where you can catch your breath,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sort your supplies, and prepare for the next encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where the journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where you return. If you're lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Underside: The Lift</strong> - A single-player <strong>horror roguelike</strong> with <strong>survival</strong> elements.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive in a house where every apartment could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/fa02dbf972782cc00c440e046c2b4591.webp?t=1749992298\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a familiar yet distorted place,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >as if you\u2019ve entered its darker reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As if you\u2019ve stepped into the Underside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The silence is suffocating. There\u2019s something behind every door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfamiliar sounds echo like whispers in the dark \u2014 unsettling and real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All you have is an old pipe and a lighter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/2fccb078533768710b40ce5bd30a9794.webp?t=1749992298\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different weapons. Search for notes. Study your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster has its own weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No direct hints. <strong>Only observation and experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/8a7878e9d07965a6c502c1891fb60d8a.webp?t=1749992298\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One life</strong>. One chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die and start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/021f26c5f3726b2af35ef90d6a36e4cc.webp?t=1749992298\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run is a new house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New layout, new monsters, new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: nothing ever repeats here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/b430830471866ee2c113afb4b96547b6.webp?t=1749992298\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The lift</strong> is the only place where you can catch your breath,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sort your supplies, and prepare for the next encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where the journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where you return. If you're lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A single-player survival roguelike horror game with randomly generated locations and permanent death. A mysterious labyrinth of post-Soviet apartments draws you into an atmosphere of solitude and plunges you into the darkness of the unknown.",
